							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10376#msg10376"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10376#msg10376">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> August 23, 2004, 11:18:32 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Why is there no, &quot;I&#039;m going to wait and see if OoW is a steaming pile of shit like GoD was,&quot; option?<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
