	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10413"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 47<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10413#msg10413"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10413#msg10413">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> August 24, 2004, 11:34:51 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I finally pre-ordered it.&nbsp; I tried to hold out a while to send a message to Sony in hopes that their pre-order numbers would be low, which I KNOW they were for a while - its what caused the whole &quot;Weekend At Smedleys&quot; and pushing the release date back.&nbsp; The main reason I am ordering it is that I want to continue progressing in EQ until I am absolutely 100% sure that WoW or EQ2 is going to be fun and have enough &quot;staying power&quot; that I know for a fact I want to quit EQ.&nbsp; I won&#039;t know that until I have played either of those games for at least 6 months and can truly say that I want to continue playing them.<br /><br />What I&#039;m surprised at is that there are 6 people who already say &quot;Its a Great Expansion and a Must Buy.&quot;&nbsp; Haven&#039;t you people learned ANYTHING yet?&nbsp; Did GoD not teach you anything?<br /><br />I don&#039;t care if you are in the beta or not.&nbsp; Search these forums for the GoD thread.&nbsp; Search a lot of the EQ-related sites for GoD.&nbsp; When it first came out, people were all &quot;OMG!&nbsp; This expansion so rocks!&quot;&nbsp; Slowly but surely, the complaints started filtering in.&nbsp; Callon complaining about how he couldn&#039;t tank crap in the expansion.&nbsp; High-end raid guild members across the servers getting fed up and quitting the game because of Uqua - far from the end zone.&nbsp; Smedley hosting a party in a sad attempt to retain the high-end guilds because of the problems with the expansion.&nbsp; One of the lead designers of GoD coming out at the Weekend at Smedley&#039;s and saying &quot;I am responsible for GoD - hate me.&nbsp; I will never let this happen again.&quot;&nbsp; The poster above is correct in that you don&#039;t need to have raided GoD to know it was a &quot;steaming pile of crap&quot;, at LEAST at release - Sony itself admitted it.&nbsp; How the expansion is NOW may be a different story.<br /><br />There is always a tendency for people to get all excited about new content when it comes out, just like there is for every new MMORPG.&nbsp; The &quot;hype&quot; is always there initially.&nbsp; But if we have learned anything from GoD, it is that it is definitely premature to come out and label the expansion as &quot;great.&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10414"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
