								Crazy Canuck<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10414#msg10414"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10414#msg10414">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> August 24, 2004, 11:40:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well basically anyone in a high end raiding guild has to get this expansion due to the new level and stat cap. Saying you are getting is for the AA&#039;s, new content etc is secondary. We all know levels &gt; all.<br /><br />5 expansions and two level cap increases in less then 2 years...<br /><br />gee thanks SoE   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />no thanks<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />AFK[65 Archon]<b> <a href="http://peternorth.com/php/home.php" target="_blank"><span style="color: blue;">Heloisa</span></a> </b>(Wood Elf)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10419"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
